    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citizen Pain</strong> is a single-player dark fantasy action game with first-person melee combat inspired by classic old-school titles. Built from the ground up in Unreal Engine by a solo developer, it blends nostalgic gameplay with modern visuals and a strong narrative core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.poster.avif?t=1749582419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.webm?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.mp4?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catherina, a young warrior, embarks on a desperate quest to challenge the Undead King, a tyrant who promises salvation through monstrous transformation. Armed with his sword and sorrow, Catherina must battle corrupted knights, traverse cursed lands, and confront the fading soul of a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.poster.avif?t=1749582419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.webm?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.mp4?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Citizen Pain</i> captures the essence of traditional single-player experiences while offering a skill-based challenge that rewards mastery and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal first-person melee combat</strong> with multiple special weapons to discover and wield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious, dangerous world to explore</strong>: from ruined villages to ancient catacombs, caverns, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of enemies and end-of-level bosses</strong>, each with distinct fighting styles, strengths, and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic, atmospheric soundtrack</strong> with unique themes for each level and boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hauntingly beautiful world</strong> crafted with Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citizen Pain</strong> is a single-player dark fantasy action game with first-person melee combat inspired by classic old-school titles. Built from the ground up in Unreal Engine by a solo developer, it blends nostalgic gameplay with modern visuals and a strong narrative core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.poster.avif?t=1749582419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.webm?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.mp4?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catherina, a young warrior, embarks on a desperate quest to challenge the Undead King, a tyrant who promises salvation through monstrous transformation. Armed with his sword and sorrow, Catherina must battle corrupted knights, traverse cursed lands, and confront the fading soul of a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.poster.avif?t=1749582419\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.webm?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752240/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.mp4?t=1749582419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Citizen Pain</i> captures the essence of traditional single-player experiences while offering a skill-based challenge that rewards mastery and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal first-person melee combat</strong> with multiple special weapons to discover and wield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious, dangerous world to explore</strong>: from ruined villages to ancient catacombs, caverns, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of enemies and end-of-level bosses</strong>, each with distinct fighting styles, strengths, and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic, atmospheric soundtrack</strong> with unique themes for each level and boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hauntingly beautiful world</strong> crafted with Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Citizen Pain is a first-person dark fantasy action game. Play as Catherina, a lone warrior fighting through cursed lands and monstrous foes to confront the Undead King. Classic single-player combat meets modern visuals in this skill-based indie experience.",
